    {
      "id": "sec_s2l10_lbl1",
      "type": "section_label",
      "data": {
        "text": "Darj zail misaalein dekhein (Darj zail misaalon par ghaur karein):",
        "title": "Darj zail misaalein dekhein (Darj zail misaalon par ghaur karein):",
        "label": "Darj zail misaalein dekhein (Darj zail misaalon par ghaur karein):"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sec_s2l10_r3",
      "type": "rule_paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Arabi mein jab kisi cheez ki qasam khaate hain toh us se pehle harf (وَ) lagaaya jaata hai, jise 'Waw-e-Qasam' kehte hain. Jis lafz ki qasam khaayi jaati hai, uske aakhri harf par kasrah (zer ــِ) aa jaata hai. Waw-e-Qasam aur uske baad aane wala lafz milkar ek mukammal jumla banta hai, aur yeh qasam aam taur par kalaam ke shuru mein aati hai.",
        "content": "Arabi mein jab kisi cheez ki qasam khaate hain toh us se pehle harf (وَ) lagaaya jaata hai, jise 'Waw-e-Qasam' kehte hain. Jis lafz ki qasam khaayi jaati hai, uske aakhri harf par kasrah (zer ــِ) aa jaata hai. Waw-e-Qasam aur uske baad aane wala lafz milkar ek mukammal jumla banta hai, aur yeh qasam aam taur par kalaam ke shuru mein aati hai.",
        "hinglish_text": "Arabi mein jab kisi cheez ki qasam khaate hain toh us se pehle harf (وَ) lagaaya jaata hai, jise 'Waw-e-Qasam' kehte hain. Jis lafz ki qasam khaayi jaati hai, uske aakhri harf par kasrah (zer ــِ) aa jaata hai. Waw-e-Qasam aur uske baad aane wala lafz milkar ek mukammal jumla banta hai, aur yeh qasam aam taur par kalaam ke shuru mein aati hai."
      }
    },
